        "text": "DEFI refers to an ecosystem of financial applications built on blockchain networks. You might think that sounds nice, but what can you really do with DeFi? Well, with a crypto wallet and some crypto, you can access a range of financial services, including borrowing, lending, payment, staking, and swaps. If you're in a country where such services are permitted. With a few clicks on a computer or smartphone, you can enjoy many financial services that usually would require a bank visit and many complicated procedures. This module will explain how some of the most popular DEFI products work and how you can use them.",
